                <pb facs="0753" n="747" xml:id="pg747"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-06-27"><hi rendition="#italic">June 27,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Principal secretary of state for foreign affairs has instructed British
                    ambassador at Washington to confer with you and German minister relative to
                    Samoa.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
